  "details": "I'm working on a world that has lots of reactive sound effects when users interact with the environment (aka teleporting through trap doors, ladders and doors to other areas of the map trigger sound effects that sound like someone using those items) and I'd love to be able to trigger a trigger event that would choose a random number (that could be set manually between two extremes) that would then activate a trigger event connected to that number (for instance, selecting number 1 would play sound01.wav, number 2 would play sound02.wav, etc etc). Would also be very helpful for pvp maps in the future, for choosing a random spawn location. ^^",
